   "_src": [
    "about.copy.041"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.text-gray-400.font-mono",
   "text": "An adaptable designer combining technical software execution with multidisciplinary creative workflows. Driven by curiosity and experimentation across 3D pipelines, generative design, and procedural audio-visual systems.",
   "_src": [
    "about.copy.042"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3.about-section-heading",
   "text": "Design Personality",
   "_src": [
    "about.copy.043"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.text-gray-400.leading-relaxed",
   "text": "Adaptable graduate and customer experience professional with a unique blend of technical design skills and operational reliability. I view software as a toolset to translate complex data or abstract audio into tangible, immersive visual narratives.",
   "_src": [
    "about.copy.044"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.text-gray-400.leading-relaxed",
   "text": "My process integrates generative design workflows with traditional 3D pipelines, reframing emerging tech as a collaborative partner to accelerate ideation while maintaining ethical standards and creative control.",
   "_src": [
    "about.copy.045"
   ]
  },
